# mcfunction: Minecraft Java Edition command syntax (Minecraft Wiki: Commands); requirements/languages/mcfunction.md
name     mcfunction mcf
keyword  execute as at if unless run positioned in store result score say tell tellraw give tp teleport
keyword  summon kill effect scoreboard objectives players add set remove function data merge modify
keyword  gamemode time weather setblock fill
builtin  true false survival creative
ident-part     :_./
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
sigil    @    : attr
operators  ~^=[]{},:.
